OL,3,GNEWSAPollution port boss calls for
OL,4,Anurdle regulations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of the port at the centre of a
OL,7,Fhuge plastic pollution crisis has now
OL,8,Fjoined calls for extra safety measures
OL,9,Fto be introduced.
OL,11,FAn estimated one billion plastic balls,
OL,12,Fknown as nurdles, entered the North Sea
OL,13,Fand have since washed up on north-east
OL,14,FEngland's beaches after a collision
OL,15,Fbetween two vessels at the Port of Tyne
OL,16,Fin July.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39502
